USER STORIES
------------

1. Develop ML Threat Detection Model
   Build an ML model to analyze HTTP requests and detect
   malicious requests in real time.

2. Implement Feature Engineering
   Extract relevant features from HTTP requests for
   effective anomaly detection.

3. Implement Signature-Based Detection
   Detect and block known web attacks using predefined
   signatures.

4. Integrate ML and Signature Detection
   Combine rule-based and ML-based detection into a
   dual-layered defense system.

5. Integrate Detection Engine with Flask
   Integrate the detection engine with the Flask application
   for real-time request analysis.

6. Evaluate and Optimize Threat Detection
   Evaluate detection accuracy and optimize response time
   and overall performance.

